WEBVTT

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.700
Stop it!

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.390
No!

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:30.340
Ugh...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.300
I can't bear this humiliation.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.720
Why do I have to get punished?

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:42.080
Normally, I'd never lose to these people.

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:46.270
Stop it!

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:50.290
Swamp Witch-sama, please forgive me! {She adds -sama here, so you could add master/mistress in front. It looks and sounds odd, so I've left it out for now} {I think adding sama will be consistent with the naming conventions}

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:53.110
No!

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:58.640
Even the little brat... {Gakincho sounds like an even greater slang version of gaki but I have no idea}

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:08.080
I have to suffer through all this because Airi's with that brat.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.460
I'll definitely find her.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.410
Wait... now I remember... {Liberal but her sou da is basically an epiphany}

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:17.590
Airi's under the control of the Swamp Witch's magic.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.150
Command magic {"command spell" / "control magic"}can't be disobeyed. {If anyone can think of something better than command, replace it. And if you do replace it, replace it everywhere else as well}

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.450
It's only a matter of time before she returns.

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:26.440
When you come back,

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:29.650
I'll punish you thoroughly. {insert heart here}

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.090
Airi...

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.620
Airi-onee-chan.

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:55.470
She said this was the last one.

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.610
Thank you, Rana.

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.760
Can you watch me work later? {chores ? how about "my work" instead ?}

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.840
But won't you be distracted if I'm present? {Airi speaks politely, so I avoided some colloquial terms}

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:07.910
No.{Left this here in case you actually want this mmn-unh tl'd: no}

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.880
I want you to watch over me.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.160
I've gotten a little bit better.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.720
How is it, onee-chan?

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.150
It's magnificent.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.940
You've improving by the day.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:46.670
Next time, temper my scythe too.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.640
Why?

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:49.270
Huh?

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:56.430
Cause if you stay here forever, you don't need to fight, right? {Kid so "cause" instead of "because" >:3}

00:03:56.970 --> 00:04:00.340
That's... that's true, I guess.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:02.570
Besides...

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:07.190
From now on, I'll be the one to protect you. {He uses ga so it's better not to shorten this}

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.240
Thank you.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:18.440
And then Airi-onee-chan said I did well! {I hate the word praise, so you could put: And then Airi-onee-chan said I did good!} { I feel its ok with praise}

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:27.240
Airi-san, I'll do the rest.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:32.190
Oh, it's okay. I'll be done in just a bit. {Alt: Just a little longer and I'll be finished.} {To Harth "be done in just a bit" How about that ?}

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:35.170
I don't know if it's my nature as a maid,

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.980
but when I'm not working, I don't feel at ease.

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:43.950
I'm sorry for always taking you up on your offer.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:50.910
When we were fighting in Queen's Blade, not even in my wildest dreams could I imagine us becoming like this. {You could add some western flare and put in my wildest dreams}

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:56.170
You saved Rana... saved our family.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.090
Thank you so much.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.280
Not at all...

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:07.110
I'm a ghost.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.460
Thanking me like that is... {Literal: Thanking me like that is...}

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:20.100
Onee-chan.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.730
You're going today too...

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:27.770
...going to the city to suck life force, right? {sucking is the word, but how about "consume" thought the word may be different}

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:35.610
I don't want you to disappear again, but... {Replace you with onee-chan if you want}

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:37.660
Sucking life force is...

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:43.720
So, it's okay if you suck mine. {Poor innocent child >:3    but other alts: So you can suck mine if you want, I don't mind if you suck mine, So you could suck mine, It's okay if you suck mine.}

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:44.770
Eh?

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:48.170
I might not be that tasty though.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.060
But if it's okay with you... {Alt: But if you don't mind..., But if you would like to...}

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:52.690
Rana...

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:55.730
I can't.

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:12.190
What have I done?

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:15.520
How could I consume Rana's life force?

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:18.000
But...

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:25.590
Ahh, he tasted so splendid. {Literal: It was a delicacy. Alt for savory: scrumptious, savory, splendid, delicious. Delicious is a more colloquial term, not befitting of delicacy}

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:26.380
Huh?

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.350
Ahh! What I am thinking?

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.820
At this rate,

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.970
I'll want to stay here forever.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:49.110
It's like I'm starting to forget that I'm a ghost.

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:53.610
Master?

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:05.130
Rana, aim well then chop.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:05.930
Okay.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.970
It went well. {Literal: It went well}

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:11.090
Yes, it did.

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:22.180
Through a contract, I was summoned into the world as a ghost.

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:26.860
And then the Swamp Witch became my master.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.760
To ensure my loyalty, {Literal: So that I remain loyal/don't become disloyal,}

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.980
Command magic {"command spells" / "control magic"}was casted on this body. { Alt: this body has been enchanted with command magic///If you use "So that," reverse the line: Command magic has been casted on this body // so that I (don't become disloyal)/remain loyal.}

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:49.890
Serving my Master is my utmost happiness.

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:57.900
I only intended for this to be a quick stop before returning to the swamp.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:01.190
Another misjudgment, huh... {Alt: Another misjudgment, huh...}

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.900
You're late. {Alt liberal: Took your time, didn't you?}

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.070
I got tired of waiting.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.910
Melona, how's Master?

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.980
She's already furious.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:32.610
She must be doubting your loyalty. {Alt to preserve JP word order: She's doubting your loyality for sure.}

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:38.180
You need some thorough discipline.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:42.320
But if you're not loyal, how about you just run away?

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:48.840
Under Master's orders, I would bear any kind-of punishment.

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:51.780
That's how it's gotta be.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.870
Wait right there, Rana. {If you want to include connotation of the command: Wait right there, Rana}

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:01.110
Let go of me! I'm going to the swamp too!

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.900
Cut that out right now!

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:10.340
There must have been a reason why Airi-san left.

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:14.560
If you care about Airi-san, you can't go after her.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:18.060
Why did she leave without saying anything?

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:23.060
It was probably hard for her to leave you, Rana.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:27.160
In that case, she could have just stayed here forever.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:28.620
Why?

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:33.010
Become stronger Rana...

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:37.770
...so that one day you can accept Airi-san's feelings.

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:40.090
Become that kind-of person.

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.410
What a great view.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.530
Now then, what sort of discipline should I start off with?

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:00.980
I told you that I would bear any kind-of punishment.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.610
How about starting already? {I was think "How about we get to it already"}

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.730
Then I won't hold back.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:22.580
Take that!

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:26.770
Stop!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.050
It tickles.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:29.740
How is it?

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:35.080
If you cry and scream that you can't take it anymore, I <i>could</i> stop.

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:39.490
This is nothing compared to Master's punishment. {@TLC: She doesn't say nothing in JP. If you can make it work without it, go for it} {Try !! XD : "If this the amount of punishment that Master willed"}

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.790
I'll show you that I can endure it. {I will show you I can endure it}

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:01.080
You held out for three days, impressive.

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.220
Of course. {Alt (goes together with next line's alt): Of course,}

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:05.320
Like I'd break from something like this. {Alt: like I'd break from this little.} {Alt with additions: like I'd break from something this trival}

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:09.610
You <i>really</i> can't go against the Swamp Witch's magic.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:14.190
The command magic {"command spell" / "control magic"}has already dispelled.

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:15.950
Dispelled?

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:17.620
Since when?

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:22.680
Since before, Queen's Blade.

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:27.640
If you weren't under the command magic's effect, then why did you come back?

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:34.380
I came back to reflect and to once again swear loyalty to Master.

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:36.430
Sounds fishy.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.270
It's the truth.

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:39.220
So then...

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:43.540
Airi-onee-chan!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:48.160
Do you hate me now?

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:50.740
Let's be together for sure. {Alt: Let's be together for sure. To editor: You can drop the definitely/for sure if you want cause tbh it just looks odd.}

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:57.420
Cause if you stay here forever, you don't need to fight, right?

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:02.220
From now on, I'll be the one to protect you.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:06.660
That's pretty low, Melona.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:10.610
I will serve Master,

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:12.520
now and forever. {Alt liberal: from now until the end of time.}

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:15.210
Tsk, how boring.

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.990
Master this, Master that.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:25.050
I don't understand how you can be so loyal even though the command magic's{"command spell" / "control magic"} dispelled.

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.140
To be honest,

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:34.090
as long as I have fun, I couldn't care less about the Swamp Witch. {Alt liberal: As long as what I'm doing is interesting / as long as I have fun // I'm not bored}

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:37.780
I wasn't even loyal to her in the first place.

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:42.530
I don't know about you, but...

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:48.850
In the future when I return to my post, I will swear even greater loyalty to Master. {to TLC: Double check the first part, I'm not 100% sure about it}

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.070
Would you like to join us, Tomoe-san? {Alt literal: How about you,Tomoe-san?   As a further note, Melpha seems very politely, so contractions are avoided.}

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.520
It will put your mind at peace.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.490
I refuse!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.590
I have told you that before.

00:13:15.590 --> 00:13:19.320
And even you Aldora-san, such shamelessness.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.510
Aldora-san has strong muscles, you know.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:26.350
I-it is about time to leave.

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:35.450
May God bless your travels with His divine protection. {His should be capitalized}

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.950
That wish, consider it granted!

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.730
That voice...

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:44.650
Nanael-sama?

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.360
Secret's out? {Literal: I've been exposed? Alt: Found me out?}

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:49.350
Yes, it is! {Alt: Yes, I have!}

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.840
Hey Melpha.

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:55.920
You're forgetting to say Archangel, the all important Archangel! {Missing = "forgetting to say/add"}

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.100
Don't make me repeat myself over and over.

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:03.000
I thought so! It really is Archangel Nanael-sama. {Isn't it suppose to be Archangel as well ?}

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.630
But, I'm unable to see you.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.940
I'm obviously in Heaven!

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:13.870
Like an Archangel would just simply come down to Earth. Really now!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:16.120
Please excuse me!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.550
Well, whatever.

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:23.920
More importantly, Archangel Nanael-sama is about to give you a mission!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.780
Mission, you say?

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:38.150
Now that Queen's Blade is over, it seems like the Swamp Witch has become active.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:42.420
Well, that's the information our Angel Administration has come up with. {That might need a better name cause it's the literal one so far. It's like a government/department for Heaven made of angels.} {"Adminstration" perhaps ?  XD tsukuru can also mean "come up with" as well}

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:46.540
By the way, the Angel Administration takes orders from the Archangel.

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.350
Don't you forget that!

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:49.530
Well, whatever!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:54.160
Go to the swamp and find out what's happening there.

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.940
Don't let me down. {~Literal alt: I'm expecting a lot of you.}

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:57.380
Got that?

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.650
Yes, Archangel! {adding -sama here looks weird. Plus you guys just want them added on names only, right?}

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:01.950
I shall serve you well.

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:07.960
I've heard the rumors, but...

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.030
I didn't know it was <i>this</i> terrible.

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:13.740
Oh, I know.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.240
Now is the time to reap the results of my training.{@TLC: Ima koso is the better matchup to the eng version atm, but using konna makes it look like the following. Solution please. @Editor ~somewhat literal TL: It's times like this that I should use the results of my training. This is your reference for when you change it.} {TLC response: Don't thin there is anything wrong with using "Now is the time..."}

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:22.610
Holy Pose! {I put Sacred Pose initially, but apparently the official english TL is Holy Pose}

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:26.290
Purification!

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.040
An intruder?

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:44.330
Looks like it.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.970
Get pumped up and go. {Western colloquial liberal TL: Get pumped up and go.}

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:52.110
This is your chance to show your loyalty to the Swamp Witch. {Alt: It's your chance//show the Swamp Witch your loyalty.}

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:01.670
Just once won't do, huh? {Alt: It seems just once/one time won't do/work//Variants of original sentence structure.}

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:06.980
If I continue the purification, it will definitely recover. {@TLC: No subject mentioned, so I went a little liberal here.} {TLC response: adding swamp is okay. perhaps an alt would be : ""}

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:11.150
You're really doing as you please, aren't you?

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:15.670
I won't let you have your way anymore. {Somewhat liberal, so more literal if you want to edit further: I won't allow any more of your self-pleasing actions.}

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:31.270
The trees, they're changing!

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:34.130
All I've done is turn them back to normal. {This is ~liberal, but your literal is: I've just turned them back to before.}

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.920
This place belongs to the Swamp Witch.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:39.320
Humans should disappear. {Literal:     Alt: fade away.}

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:44.330
Otherwise, I'll consume your life force.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:46.910
It's not my intent to fight, but...

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.490
You leave me no choice!

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:58.210
How dare you rip my clothes!

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:02.350
That woman's the dumbass angel's follower. {@TLC I'm really unsure about the last 2 words there.} {TLC response: sounds like official assistant or assistant or if you want a follower XD }

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:05.210
This is a pretty amusing fight. {You could put interesting, but I used amuse before, so "consistency"}

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:08.050
I only let down my guard a little just now.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:14.060
I won't forgive those who endanger the Swamp Witch. {alt: put the Swamp Witch in danger} {How about who "threaten" as in "those who threaten the Swamp Witch"?}

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:17.020
I stake my loyalty for Master.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:23.110
I too stake my loyalty to God, no, the Archangel. {I too sounds more formal to me than I also.}

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:26.710
I won't allow the Swamp Witch to do as she wants.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:30.570
I won't forgive mockery toward Master!

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.950
Teikyuurei, go! {@TLC your turn! Not sure how to TL this, I've got something like Form of Swift Spirits. If you can't get it, you should put GHOST BEAM!} {Its more like "low level spirits" actually like those ghosts and spectres that are lower ranking than her}

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.450
Holy Pose!

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:38.550
Crush Evil! {Alt: Abolish, Exile, any other elimination words will do}

00:17:42.590 --> 00:17:44.840
I'm losing strength... {Literal: My strength is leaking out/escaping.}

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:51.710
This showdown of loyalty, I wonder who's more devoted. {More liberal on 2nd part cause the phrase is very vague.}

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:58.820
The bout has been decided. {She speaks formal, so I put bout. Otherwise, battle is fine too}

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.890
Honorably withdraw.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:03.060
I wonder about that.

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:09.660
Stop!

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:12.240
I've got you now.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:14.030
Way to go!

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:17.070
Airi's playing on different level today. {Literal: Today, Airi's different from before.}

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:22.310
Now then, I'll be taking your life force.

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:28.010
This time, just how will you taste? {@TLC She's saying ikkai right? Not ittai? Would make so much more sense if she said the latter :\ For now I put this time, because one time/once don't really fit well in english} {TLC response: Its ittai}

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.180
You are...

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:34.890
...feeling lost, aren't you? {Literal: wavering/hestitating}

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:36.550
You're wrong!

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:41.690
I don't want you to disappear again, but...

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:43.960
Sucking life force is...

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.850
So, it's okay if you suck mine.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:49.460
Rana...

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:51.940
That expression... {She literally says face, so swapping in face is acceptable. Same as line 281}

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:55.730
I can see you are troubled by some profound doubts. {alt: deep-seated doubts. Same as line 282}

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.200
Very profound doubts.

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:00.810
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:02.570
I have no such doubts.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.970
As a maid, I have to stay by my Master's side...

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:10.190
Be honest with yourself. {Literal: Be true/honest to/with your heart. Liberal: feelings. (If you use the literal version, I suggest changing line 238)  Same as line 283}

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:12.640
As long as you don't accept who you are, {If you did not use yourself in the previous line, it may be substituted here for "who you are." Same as line 284}

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:15.760
you can't move on, now can you? {Same as line 285}

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:23.810
Have you <i>yet</i> to understand your <i>own</i> situation? {Couldn't make a good TL for the first part, so yet emphasized will have to make do. Same basic meaning anyway} {TLC response:Something like this ? "To say something like this.. Do you understand the situation you are in right now ?"}

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.880
I am a priestess.

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:28.910
Even if they may be evil beings, {I Chose evil beings cause I don't like the word monsters for mamono, and ghosts aren't really demons.}

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:32.450
I guide those who become lost towards God.

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:34.990
That is my duty after all.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:37.490
I don't want to be guided!

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.710
Prepare yourself!

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:08.290
What now?

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:10.010
What's happening?

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:13.740
I can't... anymore...

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:17.240
My stomach suddenly... {She doesn't say it, but it's obviously "hurts" next. Alt: All of a sudden...my stomach...}

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:33.730
I feel... horrible.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:40.170
Really, there's no helping you.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.620
Who would've thought you'd consume her life force. {Alt: I didn't think you'd actually suck her life force.}

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:46.510
You're such a glutton, Airi. {Colloquial alt: big eater}

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:51.510
Isn't it obvious that a ghost and a priestess are a bad match? {Literal: have low/bad affinity}

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.210
How silly of you.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:21:00.820
Even without the command magic {"command spell" / "control magic"}, I will always...

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:07.370
Oh, you're awake. I thought you were already dead.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:08.900
I...

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:13.220
I watched over you while you were out, so be grateful. {Out is sort of western slang, so you can use unconscious/knocked out as well}

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:16.470
Yes, thank you.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:28.890
God.

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.220
For your protection, {Alt: For protecting me // @Editor JP lines are this way. In english it sounds better reversed. Your call.}

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:32.980
I thank you.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:36.480
Thanks for your work. How did it go? {I originally had Nice work! for the first part, but it makes no sense to ask the 2nd part if you know they did good work}

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:40.620
Nanael-sama, I mean, Archangel Nanael-sama?

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:46.070
It was but a meager amount, but I have come back from purifying the Swamp Witch's plagued lands. {Plagued is heavy on connotation, so poisoned is fine you want to swap it in. @Timer This line originally wasn't this long, but now it is. The JP line is in reverse of what I have it now, but if you want, you can split the line}

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:50.240
Oh, nice job! That's to be expected of my servant! {Liberal: Only the best from my servant!}

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:53.890
So? Did you kill off that bimbo or that maid among maids too while you were at it? {@TLC Not sure about the middle part}

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:56.830
No. As expected, I couldn't go that far.

00:21:57.650 --> 00:22:00.440
The maid seemed to be troubled about something as well.

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:02.200
Troubled?

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:04.370
I do not know the details, but...

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:06.720
She has many issues. {A better but more colloquial alt: She has a lot going on @Editor See if you can formalize the alt version cause it works better}

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:08.510
Hmm...

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:14.120
Actually, why are you sympathizing with those swamp people? You're not running some life advice council! {@TLC Not sure about the 2nd half  @Editor: If the TLC agrees with me, then here's a liberal alt: You're not some life councilor! @Timer If you want to split this, the 2nd line starts at ~22:11:34. Listen for JINSEI}

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:15.470
Oh, yes! {Well, it's more of "I understand" in this case, but that's long + you will get weeaboos who will rage}

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:18.570
Geez, you're so useless! {Alt: God, you're so useless. I prefer God over Geez (does anyone still say that lol) but it might be misunderstood here since we're in a religious setting}

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:23.740
I said it was a mission from me, so do a better job! {Alt: so do a better job!}

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:26.540
Ah, please excuse me.

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:34.650
That expression...

00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:38.300
I can see you are troubled by some profound doubts.

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:43.100
Be honest with yourself.

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:45.700
As long as you don't accept who you are,

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:48.340
you can't move on, now can you?

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:50.540
Hey.

00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:51.330
Huh?

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:55.240
Melona, are you honest with yourself?

00:22:56.910 --> 00:22:58.560
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:11.440
I'm always honest.

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:14.820
I do all the fun stuff, and skip the rest. {@Editor ~somewhat awkward}

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:18.800
Lying to yourself is just pointless, right? {Literal: Boring.}

00:23:20.680 --> 00:23:22.970
It was stupid of me to ask.

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:26.090
What do you mean by that?

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:28.550
It means exactly how it sounds. {Liberal alt: Exactly what you think it means//It means what it means//Just how it sounds}

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:30.920
You picking a fight? {Alt: Are you picking a fight? Orig is more colloquial with "are" dropped}

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:37.080
I have sworn to live and be loyal to Master and yet...{It's a little awkward but I wasn't sure how to incorporate the swearing loyalty thing in there without it sounding even more awkward. Solution please.} {TLC's response: "I have sworn to live and be loyal to Master and yet..."}

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:45.070
Before I knew it, I came to have other important things.

00:23:47.590 --> 00:23:49.510
I can't stay like this. {Alt: I can't stay this way// I can't be like this/this way}

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:51.910
Airi's so earnest. {sounds like sarcasam XD}

00:23:56.070 --> 00:23:58.400
Punishment for teasing me. {Punishment is literal, but here's a liberal: Payback for teasing me.}

00:24:00.130 --> 00:24:01.750
I didn't tease you.

00:24:01.950 --> 00:24:05.620
Those are two different matters. {Unless you prefer "that is that, this is this"}

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:11.650
Well, being indecisive is really you. {~somewhat slang, so alt: Well, that indecisiveness is just like you.}

00:24:16.980 --> 00:24:22.420
As long as I don't accept who I am, I can't move forward, huh? {Technically this is a repeat of what Melpha says before. The problem is that JP doesn't specify the subject, so you could interpret it as Airi quoting Melpha or Airi reinterpreting the quote to talk about herself.}

00:24:24.060 --> 00:24:27.990
Alright! Next, we need to bring Menace back here.

00:24:28.930 --> 00:24:31.160
Oh, we do, don't we? {<-Liberal, so more literal alt: Oh, you're quite right.}

00:24:33.190 --> 00:24:34.980
I completely forgot.

00:24:35.420 --> 00:24:39.110
Stop sitting around, we're leaving right away, Melona.

00:24:39.240 --> 00:24:41.240
Eh? Right now?

00:24:41.370 --> 00:24:43.140
Can't we stay for a bit longer?

00:24:43.140 --> 00:24:44.250
No can do. {Alt: We can't.}

00:24:44.360 --> 00:24:45.580
We're going!

00:26:52.000 --> 00:26:55.210
Hey Airi, just what do you like about that brat?

00:26:55.210 --> 00:26:56.670
What's this all of a sudden? {Seriously overused phrase, but it works}

00:26:56.670 --> 00:27:02.270
But you know, no matter how faithful of a servant you are to the Swamp Witch, for Miss Ghost Airi to have {SO LONG. Anyway, she does say Miss Ghost AIri but think of it as taunting her as how you might speak politely to someone during an argument to express sarcasm. @TLC Have fun with this and the next two lines}

00:27:02.300 --> 00:27:06.350
opened her heart and hesitate about a little boy who's barely potty-trained...

00:27:06.350 --> 00:27:09.540
Don't know what to think or make of that, but it's just too funny. {Add I in front if phrases bother you}

00:27:09.540 --> 00:27:11.450
You just... {Alt: Hey now...//Hey you...//You...}

00:27:11.450 --> 00:27:12.980
Then how about this?

00:27:13.520 --> 00:27:16.710
Next time, Revival! Menace's Royal Palace of Pleasure!

00:27:17.060 --> 00:27:19.250
Onee-chan, I love you.
